r

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:52.050
We're going to take a bath!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:54.340
It's so big!

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:57.160
It's so amazing!

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:58.720
Isn't it awesome?

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.460
It's true!

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.680
It's awesome!

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.910
That's not what I meant.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:15.630
Look, look!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.650
First you have to wash 
your body thoroughly.

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:20.450
Okay.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.110
Do you want me to wash your back?

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:24.670
Sure, thanks.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.270
Do you want me to wash your back?

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:30.950
That's thoughtful of you!

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:37.960
Hey! Stop that! 
It tickles for some reason.

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:39.230
Really?

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:41.810
You have to scrub harder, Panda.

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:46.060
Ow! Don't use your damn nails!

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:47.430
Sorry.

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:53.770
My eyes burn.

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:55.240
Hurry up and rinse it off.

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.550
Mr. Grizzly...

00:16:58.840 --> 00:16:59.880
Who's that?

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:11.730
I feel all better.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:14.200
I'll rinse you off, too, Mr. Grizzly.

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:15.590
Sure, thanks.

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:18.970
Ow, that's hot!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.770
What the hell?! That's really hot!

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:22.020
I'm sorry.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:24.790
Turn the red knob for hot water.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.730
The blue knob is for cold water.

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:28.190
Got it.

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:31.320
That's cold!

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:33.460
Control the damn temperature better!

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:34.360
I'm sorry.

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.530
Ow, that's hot!

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:39.700
That's cold!

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:42.370
That's hot!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:43.790
That's cold!

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:45.790
Um, uh...

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:50.820
That's enough, Panda.  
I appreciate your effort.

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:57.670
We smell really good, now.

00:17:57.670 --> 00:18:00.010
What scent is this shampoo?

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.910
It smells really delicious.

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:04.980
It's this.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:07.440
Bear Bamboo Grass Shampoo

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:07.440
Bear Bamboo Grass Shampoo.

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.530
I wonder if you can drink it.

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:11.400
Don't even think about it.

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:12.890
Well then,

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:15.840
let's try putting it 
in the bath, Panda.

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:17.510
Great idea!

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:19.860
No, it's not. Don't do it.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:30.330
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.300
Look at it fly!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:36.510
Exactly. Good job.

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:38.960
How do you do that?

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.220
Like this.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:50.560
Knock it off!

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:52.560
Jeez...

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:54.070
Where are you going?

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:56.280
I like the sauna.

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:58.720
That's a fish <i>(sakana)</i>!

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:01.620
That's an antenna <i>(antena)</i>!

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:05.490
That's sleight of hand <i>(tejina)</i>!

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.660
What's a sauna?

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:14.410
I'm sweating a lot for some reason.

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:16.600
That's the good thing about saunas.

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:18.440
I feel like I'm being steamed.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:20.470
That's what's great for your body.

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:22.850
I'm at my limit.

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:26.450
Lame.

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:28.310
Me, too.

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:31.270
I can't do it...

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:34.030
You guys lack endurance.

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:43.240
5 Minute Timer

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:56.250
Time feels like it's passing 
really slow today.

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:02.490
I'm at my limit, too.

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:04.680
I'm getting out.

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:12.730
Ah!

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.610
So it was you guys!

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:25.660
Polar 
Bear's 
Café

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:28.290
That was fun.

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:31.600
Having a night out is fun!

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:35.250
I'm a bit hungry, 
so let's go have a drink.

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:37.170
Sounds good.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.250
Ooh, what's going on?

00:20:40.890 --> 00:20:42.170
Hey, there!

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:45.520
You got a new guy with ya today.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:48.620
Let's start with two draft beers, pops.

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:50.810
And an iced coffee.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:52.690
This ain't a café.

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:59.010
This looks yummy!

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:03.840
Don't eat the stick, too...

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:06.330
It's so good!

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:07.910
There you go.

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:09.620
Thanks.

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:12.290
Having a night out is great.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.560
It is, isn't it?

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:16.540
If life has days, it also has nights.

00:21:17.010 --> 00:21:19.880
If there's light, there's dark, too.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:23.230
There're plenty of fun 
things to do in the dark.

00:21:23.230 --> 00:21:25.420
It's nice because you 
have either option.

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:27.800
That's deep, man.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.140
That's true.

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:34.550
Pandas are great because they're 
both black and white.

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:37.880
That's right. Exactly. 
You've got a point.

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:41.680
Indeed.

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:47.320
Grizzly.

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.370
Yeah?

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:53.080
Panda's conked out.

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:57.760
Why the hell am I the one 
that has to carry him back?

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:03.010
That was so fun...

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:08.470
He said he had fun.

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:11.300
Jeez.

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:18.810
Well, I guess I don't mind if 
we bring him along again.

00:23:54.910 --> 00:24:25.410
Next Time

00:23:58.170 --> 00:23:59.820
Mr. Penguin, Mr. Penguin.

00:23:59.820 --> 00:24:00.960
What is it, Panda?

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:04.710
Tell us about a time you 
thought you were cool.

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:06.420
Well, let's see...

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:07.760
Don't worry if you don't have one.

00:24:07.760 --> 00:24:10.470
You're not even giving me two seconds 
to think about this, are you?

00:24:10.470 --> 00:24:12.090
Don't worry if you don't have one.

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:13.470
I wanted to think of one...

00:24:13.470 --> 00:24:14.720
Don't worry if you don't have one.

00:24:14.720 --> 00:24:17.150
It's up to you, Polar Bear.

00:24:17.150 --> 00:24:19.140
Next time Polar Bear's Café

00:24:19.140 --> 00:24:20.680
will be brought to you live.

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:22.330
We're going to do it normally.

00:24:21.020 --> 00:24:24.480
Panda, Tired of Boredom
Panda's Advice Room for Troubles

00:24:22.330 --> 00:24:23.420
Enjoy!
